From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Qianhui Xu <xiaqinghuan@mail.ustc.edu.cn>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 15:44:31 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: phy: qcom,x1e80100-csi2-phy: add SM8750 CSI2 PHY

SM8750 uses the same 3nm two-phase CSI2 PHY block as Kaanapali but is
programmed with its own lane settings, so describe it as
"qcom,sm8750-csi2-phy" with a "qcom,kaanapali-csi2-phy" fallback.

Same compatible pair as the one used by the SM8750 CAMSS series.

Signed-off-by: Qianhui Xu <xiaqinghuan@mail.ustc.edu.cn>
---
 .../devicetree/bindings/phy/qcom,x1e80100-csi2-phy.yaml        | 3 +++
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/phy/qcom,x1e80100-csi2-phy.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/phy/qcom,x1e80100-csi2-phy.yaml
index 6e9eb8e..4b531a6 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/phy/qcom,x1e80100-csi2-phy.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/phy/qcom,x1e80100-csi2-phy.yaml
@@ -20,6 +20,9 @@ properties:
       - enum:
           - qcom,kaanapali-csi2-phy
           - qcom,x1e80100-csi2-phy
+      - items:
+          - const: qcom,sm8750-csi2-phy
+          - const: qcom,kaanapali-csi2-phy
       - items:
           - const: qcom,glymur-csi2-phy
           - const: qcom,x1e80100-csi2-phy
